Följande nomentklatur införes:
 
 
Vs    : velocity of a light source defined in relation to the fix
        coordinate system (Z)

Vm    : velocity of a mirror surface defined in relation to the fix
        coordinate system (Z)

Vmos  : velocity of an outgoing light ray as measured in relation
        to the source reference (S)

Vmis  : velocity of an incoming light ray as measured in relation
        to the source reference (S)

Vmom  : velocity of an outgoing (reflected) ray as measured at the
        mirror surface as reference (M)

Vmim  : velocity of an incoming light ray hitting the mirror as
        measured at the mirror surface as reference  (M)

Vmiz  : velocity of an incoming light ray as measured in the
        reference system (Z)

Vmoz  : velocity of an outgoing light ray as measured in the
        reference system (Z)

Vrel  : the relative  velocity Vrel = (Vm - Vs) between the source
        and the mirror as measured from (S) or (M)



