-----------------------------

Velocity of outgoing ray from         :    Vmoz = c + Vs
source towards the mirror
Reference : ZERO SYSTEM


Velocity when hitting the mirror      :    Vmim = Vmoz - Vm
Reference : MIRROR SYSTEM                       = (c + Vs) -Vm
                                                = c - Vrel

Velocity of reflected ray,                 Vmom = - Vmim
Reference: MIRROR SYSTEM              :         = -c - Vs + Vm
                                                = -c +Vrel

Velocity of reflected ray             :    Vmiz = Vmom +Vm
Reference: ZERO SYSTEM                          = -c - Vs +Vm +Vm
                                                = -c - Vs +2*Vm
                                                = -c +Vrel + Vm

 
--------------------------------------------------------------------- 
