--------------------------------------------------------------------- 
 
 
Velocity of reflected ray             :    Vmis = Vmiz - Vs
Reference: SOURCE SYSTEM                        = -c - Vs +2*Vm -Vs
                                                = -c -2*Vs + 2*Vm
                                                * -c + 2*Vrel
